e if we knew anymore as to if it had been decided to do a Beast quickstart or not.<br /> I really like the quickstarts done in the past, and have found them excellent for getting a feel for the particular game - the quickstarts have directly led to me buying the Hunter and Demon core books as they really sold the game for me, so it would be a shame to lose that chance to see what Beast (and of course any other new lines brought out) are like.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11621-geosharp","name":"geosharp","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-15T05:07:38-07:00","id":865894,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>geosharp</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/677950-quickstart?p=865886#post865886\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey,<br /> Not sure what the rules are about necro'ing threads, so sorry if this breaks them.<br /> <br /> Just thought I'd post to see if we knew anymore as to if it had been decided to do a Beast quickstart or not.<br /> I really like the quickstarts done in the past, and have found them excellent for getting a feel for the particular game - the quickstarts have directly led to me buying the Hunter and Demon core books as they really sold the game for me, so it would be a shame to lose that chance to see what Beast (and of course any other new lines brought out) are like.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'd agree with this. Also, it's nice to see someone new around.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-15T16:26:09-07:00","id":866162,"title":"","content":"I didn't realise new signups were a bit of a rarity :-) I've played nWoD/CofD quite a lot over the years and enjoyed it, especially the big open game we did, most the different types worked well together. i'm curious to to see what the 2nd editions bring, and how much they change things. However, never having really kept up with the forums, I was totally unaware of the whole Onyx Path thing and the change in WW's direction until I read they'd been bought by Paradox, at which point I started investigating.<br /> <br /> Also glad that you agree the quickstarts are a boon - I know they make Onyx Path no money directly for the work put in, but I do think they help sales in the long run. I've just ran the Hunter quickstart for a group of friends, hopeful it might convince one or 2 of them to at least get the pdf as they seemed to enjoy it :-)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11621-geosharp","name":"geosharp","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":